{"id":"memorial_103305","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial103300","label":"Memoirs · The Cursed Crystals.txt"},"label":"Crack Crack","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_103304","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_103305_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"The Nikke and I were stunned by what we saw."},{"id":"memorial_103305_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"Suddenly, we heard the sound of glass shattering."},{"id":"memorial_103305_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"The deceased Nikke bolted upright and looked at us with dead, hollow eyes."},{"id":"memorial_103305_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"We fled at once."},{"id":"memorial_103305_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"I immediately requested an extended leave, while the other Nikke asked for her memory to be erased."},{"id":"memorial_103305_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"What on earth happened back there?"},{"id":"memorial_103305_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"It must have been because of those cursed crystals."},{"id":"memorial_103305_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_33_05_description","text":"The sound of that glass breaking haunts my dreams to this day."}]}